    [
     1,
     "<div lang=\"PT\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Terrence,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">I installed both semTools and lavaan lastest versions from git_hub.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">Still, have an error:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">1: In lav_model_vcov(lavmodel = lavmodel2, lavsamplestats = lavsamplestats,  :<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">  lavaan WARNING:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">    Could not compute standard errors! The information matrix could<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">    not be inverted. This may be a symptom that the model is not<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">    identified.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">2: In lav_test_satorra_bentler(lavobject = NULL, lavsamplestats = lavsamplestats,  :<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#002240;word-break:break-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ff628c\">  lavaan WARNING: could not invert information matrix</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Consolas;color:white\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">The models’ seems to be unidentified? I wonder if for ordinal items some other identification procedure (thresholds, or similar) needs to be done or if it’s just a problem with sample size (n=390, second order factor with 15 ordinal items, 8 groups) and polychoric correlation estimation…<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">I attach the rds database, if you care to try…<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">Thanks in advance!<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\">João<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; <b>On Behalf Of </b>Terrence Jorgensen</span></p></div></div>"
